#. type: Attribute 'xreflabel' of: <chapter>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/mail.xml:8
#, xml-text
msgid "MTA"
msgstr "MTA"

#. type: Content of: <chapter><title>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/mail.xml:11
#, xml-text
msgid "Mail Server Software"
msgstr "Logiciário de Servidor de Mensagens"

#. type: Content of: <chapter><para>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/mail.xml:14
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"MTAs are the programs which transport mail from one machine to the other. "
"The traditional MTA is <application>Sendmail</application>, however there "
"are several other choices."
msgstr ""
"&quot;MTAs&quot; são os aplicativos que transportam mensagens de uma máquina"
" para outra. O &quot;MTA&quot; tradicional é o "
"&quot;<application>Sendmail</application>&quot;, porém existem várias outras"
" escolhas."

#. type: Content of: <chapter><para>
#: blfs-en/server/mail/mail.xml:20
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"In addition to the SMTP servers, there is also a POP/IMAP server (Dovecot)."
msgstr ""
"Em adição aos servidores SMTP, também existe um servidor POP/IMAP (Dovecot)."

#, xml-text
#~ msgid ""
#~ "As well as SMTP servers there is a POP server (qpopper) and an IMAP server "
#~ "(Courier-IMAP)."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Além dos servidores &quot;SMTP&quot;, existe um servidor &quot;POP&quot; "
#~ "(&quot;qpopper&quot;) e um servidor &quot;IMAP&quot; (&quot;Courier-"
#~ "IMAP&quot;)."
